    "hash_49941b6e71c92089": "Shadow 3-1",
    "hash_6a2111cb85d93baf": "Shepherd",
    "hash_16557b41a0b610d1": "Vance",
    "hash_38b8713d8f6eb270": "On it.",
    "hash_4bceaabe342c95fd": "Who the fuck are these guys?",
    "hash_16ab5a67afaa9304": "All stations\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 troops in contact! Taking effective fire. Multiple casualties!!",
    "hash_12aa617bf37c2611": "Back up, back up!",
    "hash_310ecb623a336167": "CONTACT!!",
    "hash_2a9241a94efb0946": "Dipaolo- lean out and cover him.",
    "hash_612ebbd2413cf968": "Light \xe2\x80\x98em up Dipaolo!",
    "hash_68b28858a9b710b5": "Not Al Qatala!",
    "hash_31f5e7515881ea1c": "Not AQ, that\xe2\x80\x99s for sure!",
    "hash_3861430a606ad458": "Vance, Dipaolo, go help him out.",
    "hash_1a082d2533c9605b": "Eliminate that threat, Shadows!",
    "hash_a361c8577cec8b9": "Reconnaissance said the route was clear of enemy activity. The reports were wrong.",
    "hash_3c433dd4b61d026": "Russian paramilitary from the Konni group were in the region pulling security.",
    "hash_14f871fcfe0f478d": "The shipment was spotted before it arrived at its destination.",
    "hash_4d140a14d58a44a1": "We need a \xe2\x80\x98terp out here, what\xe2\x80\x99s the call, sir\xe2\x80\xa6?",
    "hash_77bda3d9a7b5fc59": "This is Gold Eagle actual. DO NOT LOSE THAT CARGO!!",
    "hash_5e965b6213e4bd21": "3-1 is down\xe2\x80\xa6!!",
    "hash_6f4b7515fb3517d6": "Ain\xe2\x80\x99t fuckin Al Qatala\xe2\x80\xa6!!",
    "hash_2002282fd97370fd": "Back up, back up!!",
    "hash_4dd6d81ca06c6f09": "Contact\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 rear!",
    "hash_75e8cb6149ace569": "WHAT THE FUCK?!",
    "hash_373969ad8d69e844": "Who the fuck are these guys?!",
    "hash_d08ba19fe81428f": "That\xe2\x80\x99s a lotta fuckin\xe2\x80\x99 milk.",
    "hash_1abc1ce705917c17": "What\xe2\x80\x99s this?",
    "hash_7e6808dfd226d75c": "Yep, yep.",
    "hash_4ca4681a6b898a31": "3, this is Erikson, what\xe2\x80\x99s up?",
    "hash_75b6fb1e8fcae7a": "Shadow-2 to Gold Eagle Actual.",
    "hash_38b07b124b4a8733": "Stand by, comin\xe2\x80\x99 to ya.",
    "hash_40d845017bd7a2cd": "Thirsty friends\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_221de40aa98e2014": "Three Shadow victors exiting highway 7-Zulu, no issues, Actual.",
    "hash_1ac0a590530a1ded": "What are we carrying this time, Graves?",
    "hash_504a843dba44b779": "Yep, yep.",
    "hash_31ba6e4d69bc25e8": "If I told ya, I\xe2\x80\x99d have to kill ya\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_23a285302fd90784": "Shepherd\xe2\x80\x99s waitin\xe2\x80\x99 for a sitrep, don\xe2\x80\x99t leave him hangin\xe2\x80\x99. Out.",
    "hash_270b9274ca19818f": "This\xe2\x80\x99s nothin\xe2\x80\x99 but a milk run, boys. Guns for the good guys\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 You\xe2\x80\x99ll be back at HQ for breakfast. Don\xe2\x80\x99t shit the bed and there\xe2\x80\x99ll be bonuses all around. Find me when you're back...",
    "hash_62f24fd7202b8217": "Got a vehicle in the road.",
    "hash_5d9d1ca6ee5ea733": "Copy. Get that cargo delivered on time\xe2\x80\xa6do not fail\xe2\x80\xa6 Eagle out.",
    "hash_57f69291125837e": "Send traffic, 2.",
    "hash_44e834e0da903cd7": "Do not fail\xe2\x80\xa6? Told you this shit was important.",
    "hash_adfdc58a2f83bce": "I bet he\xe2\x80\x99d do it, too.",
    "hash_4aef1ad5e2fd6e77": "Three containers\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_72edf71d2c39f295": "Yep, yep.",
    "hash_3f32990a817e88cc": "I don\xe2\x80\x99t like this.",
    "hash_2ed1371dc94e1fcc": "Handle it\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 Keep the line movin\xe2\x80\x99.",
    "hash_6b061edcee621550": "Min Fadlik, min fadlik\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_b715fa79e9e6918": "Yalla, yalla, you gotta move\xe2\x80\xa6 sir you need to move\xe2\x80\xa6 Yataharak. Ya- Yataharak.",
    "hash_63e72e471a7f728b": "Graves, Vance- Be advised- we\xe2\x80\x99re held up, sortin\xe2\x80\x99 it out now.",
    "hash_1b81d153a5c9a682": "His Arabic is atrocious.",
    "hash_1ef670e20dc9fad9": "Roger that.",
    "hash_2561e7d39cc023e6": "Reinforcements!",
    "hash_3d2b22ae8ef335a4": "Shit! Reinforcements!",
    "hash_17e6148485063b6": "All stations- We got Russian PMCs out here.",
    "hash_3607470d19595c2a": "Enemy troop is Russian.",
    "hash_2ae9eda5c15d54fd": "Graves, we need reinforcements.",
    "hash_69d9ea6dc9057b1d": "On the roof!",
    "hash_7bbaee242ab55d7f": "Repo, now!!",
    "hash_2e355afe98c0d748": "Roger-",
    "hash_47a13d20cfaa5ff7": "The fuck are they doin\xe2\x80\x99 out here\xe2\x80\xa6?",
    "hash_1a232cf106562f58": "They\xe2\x80\x99re everywhere!!",
    "hash_6c23bb49576c2da7": "We gotta move!! Let\xe2\x80\x99s go!!",
    "hash_78b4743b34998097": "Actual, my boys are gettin stitched up, they need air support.",
    "hash_43382ca512ee213f": "Actual, requesting QRF\xe2\x80\xa6!",
    "hash_1b6e44628944fd83": "Erikson, you heard him.",
    "hash_29dabdf58a5f7db2": "General, they need help.",
    "hash_4232d0b60f6df82b": "Repeat Russian?",
    "hash_74788f3e076591ec": "Say again?",
    "hash_52a8782a07a4470d": "Goddamnit Graves-!! You said the route was clear.",
    "hash_284ef081310c4324": "Negative- we fight with the guns we have.",
    "hash_7e1a975f788f692a": "We can\xe2\x80\x99t do that Graves and you know it\xe2\x80\xa6!",
    "hash_402c712e108a66c": "You are my help! Now fix this!",
    "hash_51ca9f6c39ae962e": "Eyes high, watch those buildings!",
    "hash_94db7fb1a379dba": "Fuck\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 Get down!!",
    "hash_68f102ce600dd774": "RPG!!",
    "hash_386bdbe5112afb1b": "There\xe2\x80\x99s too many!",
    "hash_4852c5f6e4651585": "These guys are Russian PMCs!!",
    "hash_46fb9c09eb0b4bd3": "We\xe2\x80\x99re surrounded!!",
    "hash_37015de6be6c01af": "Who the fuck are they?!",
    "hash_20636039944b94c5": "I uncovered redacted intel regarding a black bag operation conducted by General Shepherd and carried out by Shadow Company.",
    "hash_57968e80840b6b53": "The mission did not go as planned...",
    "hash_2d1de96c2f211852": "They were transacting American made Ballistic missiles to our allies fighting Russians in the Middle East.",
    "hash_4193a65536fd2828": "Argh.",
    "hash_518fb6d5697af82d": "Erikson\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_6c91a63ccb19310f": "Fuck.",
    "hash_7ff628db425ac32": "Graves-!",
    "hash_5b0cf6f9e1f68c41": "They've got the radio-!",
    "hash_328770d2e1eb17d9": "Vance\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_1385d35c09a88888": "All Shadows- report\xe2\x80\xa6 Any station this net, this is Shadow Actual-what is your status?",
    "hash_71d6a922df70b78": "Erikson, it\xe2\x80\x99s Graves, what's your location\xe2\x80\xa6? Fuuuuck\xe2\x80\xa6 Vance, Dipaolo, do you copy\xe2\x80\xa6?",
    "hash_3b0398ba81bf9f6a": "General, I need an armed bird up now for visual- my men are in trouble, sir\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_207f86093e084166": "General my men are taking fire from Russian PMCs\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 This situation is not yet under control--",
    "hash_756190b3deec0981": "General, we are losing this cargo--",
    "hash_25235ea44b69b5d4": "Shepherd, this was a direct firefight with Russian paramilitary\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94",
    "hash_1c1ff1baba392491": "We need to clean this up, General.",
    "hash_b42ea5fe75e67c2": "Yes, sir\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_2534c6ef41beac69": "Double-tap them. They might be playing dead.",
    "hash_18bf8766ce8c89ef": "Move out\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_5788bbe5f2f28eb3": "Security rounds- don\xe2\x80\x99t leave anyone out.",
    "hash_b5224e4c9a420c6": "3 containers, captain. American ballistic missiles.",
    "hash_75200d6e81fbeadc": "Yes sir.",
    "hash_56a0f9e89ac18e4e": "Hassan\xe2\x80\x99s got one more- we need to find it...",
    "hash_7bc831e09c11f846": "He and Graves buried it. The cover up is always worse than the crime.",
    "hash_6d7f45a64cdd4179": "Russia didn\xe2\x80\x99t need the missiles- So they gave them to Hassan.",
    "hash_3ffe5a0a5bc7b506": "Shepherd\xe2\x80\x99s intentions were good, but the shipments were illegal and off the books.",
    "hash_7051f441730039d8": "The Russians executed the entire squad and got a hold of Shadow\xe2\x80\x99s comms.",
    "hash_3fb54835199d876f": "They learned Shepherd was behind it.",
    "hash_56e6df2424d90623": "They learned Shepherd was behind it. Russia gave the missiles to Hassan. Shepherd's intentions were good, but the shipments were illegal and off the books.",
    "hash_1dce24457a30e66c": "Three missiles were stolen.",
    "hash_583e2c5cc10364e9": "We\xe2\x80\x99ve only found two.",
    "hash_e4e47102d2745ca": "We were getting too close and they weren\xe2\x80\x99t gonna let that happen.",
    "hash_35cf7b2eeb745108": "I want this situation contained. That means this operation will not-be-reported.",
    "hash_40410522425c6404": "--That is precisely why there will be no response-",
    "hash_285c4c6c9d9876d7": "The identity of the enemy has not been confirmed. Do you copy?",
    "hash_26b0cff7012b0c66": "There is nothing to clean\xe2\x80\xa6 CAUSE IT NEVER HAPPENED, is-that-clear?",
    "hash_2a4519cf6132776e": "There was-no-cargo\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 This mission does not and did not exist.",
